From: Pratha <pratha@example.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Register GroupNormalization schema for kMSInternalNHWCDomain

Add GroupNormalization operator to the NHWC domain schema registration to support
shape inference for GroupNormalization when layout transformation is applied.

GroupNormalization opset 13+ supports NHWC layout transformation and requires
proper schema registration for shape inference after the transformation.

---
 .../core/graph/contrib_ops/internal_nhwc_onnx_schemas.cc | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/onnxruntime/core/graph/contrib_ops/internal_nhwc_onnx_schemas.cc b/onnxruntime/core/graph/contrib_ops/internal_nhwc_onnx_schemas.cc
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/onnxruntime/core/graph/contrib_ops/internal_nhwc_onnx_schemas.cc
+++ b/onnxruntime/core/graph/contrib_ops/internal_nhwc_onnx_schemas.cc
@@ -111,6 +111,8 @@ void OpSet_Internal_NHWC_ONNX::ForEachSchema(const std::function<void(ONNX_NAMES
   REGISTER_NHWC_SCHEMA(fn, DepthToSpace, 11);
   REGISTER_NHWC_SCHEMA(fn, DepthToSpace, 13);

+  REGISTER_NHWC_SCHEMA_WITH_ACTIVATION(fn, GroupNormalization, 13);
+
   REGISTER_NHWC_SCHEMA_WITH_ACTIVATION(fn, InstanceNormalization, 6);

   REGISTER_NHWC_SCHEMA_WITH_ACTIVATION(fn, Conv, 1);
--
2.40.0
